{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Python 3 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Python 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport sys\nimport bisect\n\nn, m = map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split())\na = list(map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split()))\n\nn1 = n // 2\n\ndef sums1():\n    res = []\n    stack = [(0, 0)]\n    while stack:\n        idx, s = stack.pop()\n        if idx == n1:\n            res.append(s)\n        else:\n            stack.append((idx+1, (s + a[idx]) % m))\n            stack.append((idx+1, s))\n    return res\n\ndef sums2():\n    res = []\n    stack = [(n1, 0)]\n    while stack:\n        idx, s = stack.pop()\n        if idx == n:\n            res.append(s)\n        else:\n            stack.append((idx+1, (s + a[idx]) % m))\n            stack.append((idx+1, s))\n    return res\n\na1 = sums1()\na2 = sums2()\n\na1 = sorted(set(a1))\nans = 0\nend = len(a2) - 1\n\nfor i in a2:\n    j = bisect.bisect_left(a1, m - i)\n    if j > 0:\n        cand = a1[j-1] + i\n        if cand > ans:\n            ans = cand\n\nprint(ans)\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        StringTokenizer st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n        int n = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int m = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int[] a = new int[n];\n        st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            a[i] = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        }\n\n        int n1 = n / 2;\n\n        // sums for first half\n        List<Integer> a1 = new ArrayList<>();\n        Deque<int[]> stack1 = new ArrayDeque<>();\n        stack1.push(new int[]{0, 0});\n        while (!stack1.isEmpty()) {\n            int[] cur = stack1.pop();\n            int idx = cur[0];\n            int s = cur[1];\n            if (idx == n1) {\n                a1.add(s);\n            } else {\n                stack1.push(new int[]{idx + 1, (s + a[idx]) % m});\n                stack1.push(new int[]{idx + 1, s});\n            }\n        }\n\n        // sums for second half\n        List<Integer> a2 = new ArrayList<>();\n        Deque<int[]> stack2 = new ArrayDeque<>();\n        stack2.push(new int[]{n1, 0});\n        while (!stack2.isEmpty()) {\n            int[] cur = stack2.pop();\n            int idx = cur[0];\n            int s = cur[1];\n            if (idx == n) {\n                a2.add(s);\n            } else {\n                stack2.push(new int[]{idx + 1, (s + a[idx]) % m});\n                stack2.push(new int[]{idx + 1, s});\n            }\n        }\n\n        // unique sorted a1\n        Set<Integer> set = new HashSet<>(a1);\n        a1 = new ArrayList<>(set);\n        Collections.sort(a1);\n\n        int ans = 0;\n        for (int i : a2) {\n            int target = m - i;\n            int pos = Collections.binarySearch(a1, target);\n            if (pos < 0) {\n                pos = -pos - 2; // insertion point - 1\n            } else {\n                pos = pos - 1; // exact match, take previous\n            }\n            if (pos >= 0) {\n                int cand = a1.get(pos) + i;\n                if (cand > ans) {\n                    ans = cand;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        System.out.println(ans);\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-1.0728830375228426e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -0.00015960850578267127, -1.728519782773219e-05, 0.0, -0.16022419929504395, -0.048623211681842804, 0.0, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.000163541772053577, -4.529942543740617e-06, 0.0, -0.022288069128990173, -0.0003398079425096512, -1.3589766240329482e-05, -0.0004318020073696971, 0.0, -2.7418097943154862e-06, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, 0.0, -0.00016056202002801, -0.04858766868710518, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -2.0265373677830212e-05, -0.062010977417230606, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -7.271740287251305e-06, -1.2993727978027891e-05, -0.04860595241189003, -3.814689989667386e-06, -8.77341881277971e-05, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -0.00028355870745144784, -3.540453326422721e-05, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -1.5497195136049413e-06, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -1.7881377516459906e-06, 0.0, -0.00020346954988781363, -7.152555099310121e-07, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.20141556859016418, -0.3869129717350006, -0.160430446267128, -2.3841574147809297e-05, -1.4305104514278355e-06, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.825220326485578e-05, -3.6954811548639555e-06, -1.4543427823809907e-05, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -2.3841830625315197e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.264974000354414e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -5.960462772236497e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0007098776986822486, -5.602820692729438e-06, -4.5536911784438416e-05, -2.38418